# SCENARIO: batch1_48_backpack   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: auto   BOTCFG: off
# #48: a /cavebot reload must keep the bot's backpack. DEBUG MODE (pinned $R, awake).
# Discriminator: `potion health` drinks one potion -> one fewer potion + an EMPTY FLASK in the bag
# (the flask is not part of equipBot's seed). The old reactivation wiped and re-seeded the bag
# (flask gone, potion count restored); the fix keeps both. Camera = @cast viewer of $R, which gets
# the caster's open backpack at init (sendCastViewerInit), so `self` lists cont_*.
@srv cmd "$R" hibernate via=queue
@srv sleep 3
@cam:$R login
@srv sleep 3
@cam:$R self as=S0
@srv cmd "$R" potion health via=queue
@srv sleep 3
@cam:$R self as=S1
@cam:$R logout
@srv sleep 2
@srv cmd _global reload via=queue timeout=90
@srv sleep 25
@srv cmd "$R" status via=queue expect="state="
@srv cmd "$R" hibernate via=queue
@srv sleep 3
@cam:$R login
@srv sleep 3
@cam:$R self as=S2
@cam:$R logout
